  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -22,9 +22,20 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n // The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2025-02[]\n+* wssalink:2025-02[]\n+Dissection engine crash.\n+wsbuglink:20509[]. {notable}\n+// cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: 5321308630\n+// Fixed in release-4.4: 29a4f378ab\n+// Fixed in release-4.2: 8c186dbb38\n+// CVSS AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\n+// CWE-120\n+// * Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-04-25-7554.pcap. wsbuglink:20509[].\n+\n+// * wssalink:2025-03[]\n // Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n-// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n+// wsbuglink:xxx[]. {notable}\n // cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n // Fixed in master: xxx\n // Fixed in release-4.4: xxx\n@@ -39,6 +50,14 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark grabs your ID at 3 am, goes to Waffle House, and insults people.\n \n+* GRPC: protobuf_json only displays the truncated string value. wsbuglink:20392[].\n+* Trailing octet after IPv4 packet end is not detected or displayed in raw bytes. wsbuglink:20423[].\n+* Wireshark does not correctly decode LIN \"go to sleep\" in TECMP and CMP. wsbuglink:20463[].\n+* Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-04-25-7554.pcap. wsbuglink:20509[].\n+* WebSocket per-message compression extentions: fail to decompress server messages (from the 2nd) due to parameter handling. wsbuglink:20531[].\n+* null. wsbuglink:20539[].\n+* The LL_PERIODIC_SYNC_WR_IND packet is not properly dissected (packet-btle.c) wsbuglink:20554[].\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n@@ -55,9 +74,21 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.2.10.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.2.12.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+ASAM CMP\n+F1AP\n+LIN\n+Logcat Text\n+genl\n+net_dm\n+netfilter\n+nvme\n+ProtoBuf\n+Quake\n+TECMP\n+WebSocket\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
